.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-show-generated 1 "" "Sway Things 0.1.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-show\-generated \- Print the generated sway config files as they would be written, without writing them
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things show\-generated\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIFILE\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the generated sway config files as they would be written, without writing them
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIFILE\fR]
Only this file
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
10\-input.conf
.IP \(bu 2
30\-appearance.conf
.IP \(bu 2
40\-behavior.conf
.IP \(bu 2
90\-effects.conf
.RE
